Subject: [PATCH 10/40] Full move relearner after the Elite Four

Once you're Champion, the Two Island Move Maniac teaches for free any
level-up (any level), egg, TM/HM or tutor move the Pokemon can learn.
MAX_LEVEL_UP_MOVES raised to 32 (Deoxys has 24).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
